/-!
# Shared proposed Fi22 image tables

These eight tables are the inverses of the unchanged right-action cycles in
`ImageContainmentCertificate/source/images.g`. They are numerical candidates,
not assertions about the Fi22 words or Fi23 witnesses. Independent certificates
compare each side with these same tables. In particular, modular lookup makes
`imageAction` total without assuming bijectivity or subgroup membership.

Each entry occupies twelve bits, as in the existing Fi22 generator evaluators.
`GeneratorActions/source/generate_tables.py` reproduces the data. The numerical
source and attribution are retained in `ImageContainmentCertificate/source/`.
The source application is GLS3 Table 5.3u and its Fischer-group explanation.
-/

@[expose] public section
namespace Sporadic.Fischer.Fi23.CentralizerSection.ImageContainmentCertificate.GeneratorActions

/-- Interpret a numerical lookup table on the exact Fi22 letters. -/
def tableAction (t : Nat) (x : Fin 3510) : Fin 3510 :=
  Fin.ofNat 3510 ((t >>> (12 * x.val)) % 4096)

